  - m_Id: 4202892369920
    m_Localized: Wizard
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4783878971392
    m_Localized: "The true rock of the team \u2013 boasts an immense health pool
      and can endure a barrage of hits. However, his movements are slow, making him
      easy to outpace by faster enemies."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4874626932736
    m_Localized: "A precise marksman \u2013 specializes in powerful crossbow shots,
      dealing high damage to single targets. Although reloading takes time, each
      bolt can decisively turn the tide of battle. The crossbowman excels at long
      range, but his limited mobility and moderate durability make him vulnerable
      once enemies close the distance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 4945175126016
    m_Localized: "A master of arcane arts \u2013 wields powerful spells to devastate
      enemies or support allies. Fragile in close combat, the wizard relies on positioning,
      timing, and strategy to control the battlefield. With a vast magical arsenal,
      each spell can turn the tide of battle in an instant."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5003354316800
    m_Localized: A noble warrior with balanced stats. He is neither the strongest
      nor the fastest, but his versatility allows him to adapt to any situation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 5112381054976
    m_Localized: "A deadly ranged specialist \u2013 excels at dealing consistent
      damage from afar with precise shots. Light on his feet and highly mobile, he
      can easily reposition to keep enemies at bay. However, his low health makes
      him vulnerable if foes manage to close the distance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7336779849728
    m_Localized: King
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7486822686720
    m_Localized: The absolute ruler of the battlefield. He possesses enhanced stats
      across the board and access to every ability, making him the most powerful
      character. Yet his might can be challenging to master, demanding both courage
      and wisdom.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
